n data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/s\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #3598dbff;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e(수정 완료)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cs\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e③ \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 아이템 아이콘이 어색하게 표시되는 현상을 확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/s\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #3598dbff;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e(수정 완료)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e\u000b\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e④ \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e설정 - 그래픽 - 모델 품질이 [기본 품질]인 경우, 특정 상황에서 라플라스 : 얼티밋 히어로의 배경 이\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e펙트가 사라지지 않는 현상을 확인하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e\u0005\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #3598dbff;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e（7월 27일 일부 수정) \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cs\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e⑤ 코어가 활성화된 적을 대상으로 하는 스킬이, 코어가 존재하지 않는 상태의 일부 랩쳐에게도 피해를 입히는 현상을 확인\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e 중 입\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/s\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #3598dbff;\"\u003e\u003cs\u003e \u003c/s\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e(수정 완료)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e\u000b\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cs\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e대상\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/s\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cs\u003e\u003cspan data-font-famil